          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukuyawu iseki hidikukanka, mawulu hiyakuza ala; itaŋwa nikakweji hiyakwiyila, tutumbwa tuleka nikutoŋaeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakutwala izu dindi kukuya njita yindi, muloŋa chilombu chindi chinasweji kutoha, niyena wakoŋaŋa mwaya izu dindi wukweti Ŋovu; muloŋa ifuku daYehova deneni dakutiya woma nankashi; wukutwesha kudi imena hinyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hela mwomu, funtenu kudami nanyichima yenu yejima, muleki kudya, mudili, mudishoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutabuli nyichima yenu, bayi mahinenuku. Mufunti kudi Yehova Nzambi yenu; muloŋa yena wukweti luwi, wasweja wushona, hazuwaŋa swayuku, wavulisha nikwanakena, wafuntishaŋa muchima mwivumu kwila chuma chatama nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neluki hinyi? Hadaha wakabalumuka, wakafuntisha muchima mwivumu, wakashiya nkisu kwakufumayi, wowu himulambu wawuŋa, nihimulambu wakuhuŋununa wakuhimulambu la Yehova Nzambi yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
