          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atupristu, akwakukalakela Yehova, adilili madilu hakachi kachisu nakameŋa, ahoshi nawu, Eyi Yehova, anakenaku antu eyi, bayi wuhana wuswana weyi mukusawuka, kulonda nyuza yawantu yakayiyuluku. Indi antu adi munyuza adi kuhoshelaŋadi nawu, Nzambi yawu wudi kudihi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu Yehova hakutiyila ituŋa dindi mukawu, hakutiyila muza windi luwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakwakula, hakwila muza windi nindi, Tiyenu, nakayitemeshela nitidiku, nivinyu, nimanji, mwakayiikuta; hinakayisawisha cheŋi mukachi kanyuzaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akukabeta kakuchimunswa nakayifumishaku, nakayitwala kwakulehi nanenu, nakayihaŋila kwituŋa dominina chau, dela kwamahembi hohu, chamesu awu mukaluŋalwiji kakumusela, chanyima yawu mukaluŋalwiji kakumujika; wakafulumuka ivumba dindi datama, wakanunka kahu kindi katama, muloŋa yena nakoŋi dehi nyidimu yamaneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi ituŋa, bayi wutiya womaku; tiyaku kuwaha, zaŋalalaku, muloŋa Yehova nakoŋi dehi nyidimu yamaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyama amumpata, bayi mutiya womaku, muloŋa matahu akudya mwisaŋa hiyakumena, muloŋa mutondu hiwukusoŋa nyikabu yindi, nichikuyu nimuvinyu hiyikwidisha Ŋovu jayu.",
