          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamwekesha yihayamisha nimumawulu, nihamaseki, nimashi ni kesi, niyishimi yawishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaŋwa dakabalumuka mwidima, kakweji kakabalumuka mashi, chidikukeŋa kwinza ifuku daYehova deneni, dakutiya niwoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hichakela yowu muntu wakatambika ijina daYehova wakapuluka; muloŋa mumpidi yaZiyona nimuYerusalema mwakekala akapuluka, mwomwanahoshiyi dehi Yehova, akekala nimudi anashaluku anatambiki Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.2.32"
            ]
          }
